  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#008080\">AgriCraft OptiFine Compat</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">預設情況下，Agricraft 1.16.5 無法與光影模組相容。即使是種子分析等最基礎的功能也會導致遊戲崩潰。本模組已修復以下問題。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://patreon.com/starmun\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=starmun&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://patreon.com/starmun\"></a> <a href=\"http://discord.gg/invite/s4VpDQHCTa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/743605058217836576.svg?logoColor=FFFFFF&logo=discord&color=7289DA&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://discord.gg/invite/s4VpDQHCTa\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/muqsit-0010/Prune-Addon-FTB-Chunks/blob/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/muqsit-0010/prune-addon-ftb-chunks?color=003377&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#008080\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"color:#008080\">目前修復</h3>\n<h4>種子分析器崩潰</h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">安裝光影後操作種子分析器會立即導致崩潰。本模組已修正渲染管線以徹底解決此問題。</span></p>\n<h4>農業手冊崩潰</h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">開啟農業手冊同樣會引發崩潰。本模組再次修正了渲染管線。</span></p>\n<h4>水流渲染崩潰</h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">流動的水體會導致崩潰，本模組已修正紋理集初始化來消除該錯誤。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#008080\">未來計畫</h3>\n<h4>手冊光影</h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前手冊頁面的光影效果無法正常運作。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fstar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/65aecd33-dc2b-4279-96bd-1b3b661c104d.png\"></a></p>",
